== Attacks and abilities ==
{{For|strategies for defeating Leech|Aggressive creature strategies#Leech}}

=== Bite ===
Extends their head forward slightly and bites in a 1.5-meter 48.5-degree arc, inflicting the [[Poison]] status (20 [[Damage types#Slash|Pierce]] and 70 [[Damage types#Poison|Poison]] damage). This attack has a 2-second cooldown and can be used within 1.5 meters of a player.

